{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S06、S13的感受标注较密，即使分时出现，观众也可能忙于追读而暂时顾不上听音乐；Y的短词块有时反而更容易快速掠读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用重点加亮把每段叙事的核心判断和转折直接交给观众，感受文字又按音乐进程分时出现，扫读时比较容易抓住主线，不必自己从一堆短词中拼凑意思。更重要的是，X把人物为什么怀念、为什么抗拒、为什么动摇，以及最后如何接受矛盾并继续生活，连成了清楚的心理过程；感受描写也有具体的身体反应、声音质感和情绪变化，不只是笼统地贴上悲伤、温柔、激昂等标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "63c94ccb-cc5b-4286-8cf2-5bf9e584cebc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T232222714405Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:22:56.654703+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6881fea6b1787c5f34c93bd5bbb834cba43303e886465de7cad02d33fe8e0a06", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\